The following components are adapted from the shadcn/ui new-york-v4 registry:
- message.tsx
- bubble.tsx
- input-group.tsx
- message-scroller.tsx

Source: https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui/tree/main/apps/v4/registry/new-york-v4/ui
License source: https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui/blob/main/LICENSE.md

Local adaptations use the existing cn helper, individual Radix Slot package,
and Button API. Input-group controls retain a minimum 44px touch target and
the addon also focuses textareas. Scroll controls use outline buttons and
Korean default labels, with standard prop overrides available.
Message-scroller hooks remain available directly from @shadcn/react/message-scroller
so this local wrapper only exports components for Fast Refresh.

